# Source recordings — keep the originals locally, commit only the web encodes.
# wiki-graph.mp4 is 13.7MB; wiki-graph-loop.mp4 is 0.5MB and looks the same
# at the size it's displayed. Git keeps every version of a binary forever,
# so large sources bloat the clone permanently.
assets/*-source.*
assets/wiki-graph.mp4

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
